  ('sulfato_magnesio', 'miastenia_gravis', 'Miastenia gravis', 'Myasthenia gravis', 'precaution', 'moderate', 'O magnésio pode agravar a fraqueza neuromuscular na miastenia.', 'Magnesium may worsen neuromuscular weakness in myasthenia.', 'Usar com precaução, sobretudo por via intravenosa, e vigiar a força muscular.', 'Use with caution, especially intravenously, and watch muscle strength.', 'EMC-UK (MHRA) — SmPC aprovada Sulfato de magnésio: https://www.medicines.org.uk/emc/product/10502/smpc', 'EMC-UK (MHRA) — approved Magnesium sulfate SmPC: https://www.medicines.org.uk/emc/product/10502/smpc', 1),
